# 统一行尾: 仓库里一律 LF, 检出到任何平台也都是 LF。
# 2026-09-14 之前没有这个文件, 于是每次 diff 都会刷
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告, 长期会造成无意义的行尾噪声。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确按二进制处理, 避免 Git 试图"规范化"这些文件
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.joblib binary
*.pt    binary
*.npz   binary
*.npy   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.mp4   binary
*.wav   binary
*.zip   binary
*.whl   binary
*.ico   binary

# 脚本与配置显式声明 LF (钩子在 CRLF 下会当场失败)
.githooks/*      text eol=lf
*.sh             text eol=lf
Makefile         text eol=lf
*.py             text eol=lf
*.yml            text eol=lf
*.yaml           text eol=lf
*.json           text eol=lf
*.toml           text eol=lf
*.md             text eol=lf

